        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DoralLock TK6431, Linstead Lever Trim Kit for Handlesets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDesigned to be easily gripped and held, the DoralLock Linstead Lever is a stylish solid brass lever. This lever trim kit has a modern appearance that makes it a great choice from contemporary style homes. It is available in 7 finishes. The Linstead Lever Inside Trim Kit used with the DoralLock <a href=\"/products/hanover-single-cylinder-handleset-dorallock-803871b\">Hanover Handleset</a> and the <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-montego-handleset-dorallock-810871\">Montego Handleset</a>. This is an replacement inside handle kit for these handelsets only as it is just the lever and rosette.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here or a complete <a href=\"/products/linstead-door-leverset-dorallock-6430\">Linstead Lever Set</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the DoralLock TK6431 Linstead Lever Trim Kit:\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-TK6431-specifications.pdf?v=1704262207\" target=\"new\"><b>DoralLock TK6431 Linstead Trim Kit (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
